// A model relating to itself via a self-referencing foreign key.
//
// No `children Category[]` inverse field: an inverse list field on a
// self-relation trivially satisfies validate.rs's implicit-many-to-many
// reciprocal check against itself (model == target_model), producing a
// false-positive "implicit many-to-many" diagnostic unrelated to this
// fixture's purpose. Reported separately; not fixed here (no `crates/*/src/`
// edits in this change). This fixture stays scoped to the forward FK leg,
// which is sufficient to exercise self-relation coverage.

Table Category {
  id       Int        @id @default(autoincrement())
  name     String
  parentId Int?
  parent   Category?  @relation(fields: [parentId], references: [id])
}
